&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Drive client satisfaction and retention, and identify opportunities to grow accounts - from expanded TikTok Shop scope into wider THG Ingenuity services - working with Customer Success and Business Development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;Team &amp;amp; Business Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Coach and develop Social Commerce Executives, sharing expertise and building capability across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Support the Head of Partnership Marketing in shaping the TikTok Shop and Social Commerce proposition, including pitches, case studies, new client onboarding and process improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Contribute platform and client insight to THG Ingenuity’s TikTok partnership, and share knowledge across the wider business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 1"&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Proven experience managing TikTok Shop at a senior level, ideally across multiple brands or client accounts in an agency, ecommerce or brand-side environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;A track record of setting social commerce strategy and delivering measurable commercial growth (GMV, conversion, ROI).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Strong client management experience - confident building senior relationships, presenting strategy and performance, and handling challenging conversations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Deep understanding of the TikTok Shop ecosystem, including Seller Center, affiliate and creator programmes, shoppable content, LIVE shopping and GMV Max / paid amplification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Highly data-literate, with the ability to analyse performance, draw out insight and turn it into clear actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Experience leading or mentoring others, and directing cross-functional teams to deliver to a high standard.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Excellent organisation and attention to detail, with the ability to manage multiple clients and priorities at pace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Commercially minded, proactive and solutions-focused, with a genuine passion for social commerce and creator culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
